          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-white font-normal mb-1">
            Raw Pure Powder Serving
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-emerald-100/70 mb-5 leading-relaxed">
            1 level scoop mixed in morning lemon water or smoothies. Ideal for athletes, active recovery, and maximum daily whole-food biomass.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 p-3.5 bg-black/30 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 text-left font-mono">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Total Plant Protein</span>
              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-300">1.87 g</span>
              <span class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 block">(62.39% IS 7219)</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider block">Natural Algal Iron (Fe)</span>
